    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Add to Your Wishlist</h2> Please add my game to your wishlist! I really need your support, and your subscription means the world to me.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680140/extras/c59938f6d7eb3005998ef771ff3def04.avif?t=1725711631\" width=616 height=250 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Background</h2> You were struck by the demon king's magic and turned into a sword, then fell into a well.<br>As a sword, you embark on a journey to climb the mountain, defeat the demon king, and regain your human form!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680140/extras/c1b4d28204306f2152f2f600a511b5fd.poster.avif?t=1725711631\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680140/extras/c1b4d28204306f2152f2f600a511b5fd.webm?t=1725711631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680140/extras/c1b4d28204306f2152f2f600a511b5fd.mp4?t=1725711631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Talking Stone</h2> There's a talking stone that has been sealed here for 100 years. It's very lonely.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680140/extras/97520dd5d799ba7fe39c6be0a769199a.poster.avif?t=1725711631\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680140/extras/97520dd5d799ba7fe39c6be0a769199a.webm?t=1725711631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680140/extras/97520dd5d799ba7fe39c6be0a769199a.mp4?t=1725711631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Climbing Game</h2> This is not just a climbing game\u2014there are also monsters! If they catch you, you might fall back down the mountain. But don\u2019t worry, you can fight back, after all, you are a sword!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680140/extras/e10789b61a791b400f10d4a4be8ba8c9.poster.avif?t=1725711631\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680140/extras/e10789b61a791b400f10d4a4be8ba8c9.webm?t=1725711631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680140/extras/e10789b61a791b400f10d4a4be8ba8c9.mp4?t=1725711631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Play</h2> Even though you\u2019ve been sealed as a sword, you can still move! It's truly amazing! Players can rotate the body, jump, climb, and even engage in combat!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenge the Peak</h2> Strive to reach the peak! You might slip and fall a great distance, but don\u2019t worry, you could also leap to great heights unexpectedly. The unpredictable ups and downs make the journey feel like a roller coaster!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680140/extras/e8691d63036502f494b69777d0212a3c.poster.avif?t=1725711631\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680140/extras/e8691d63036502f494b69777d0212a3c.webm?t=1725711631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680140/extras/e8691d63036502f494b69777d0212a3c.mp4?t=1725711631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple Paths</h2> During your climb, you may find that there are multiple paths\u2014some more difficult, some easier. There could be surprising traps, or perhaps hidden shortcuts that help you soar! Every road leads to Rome, so find the path that suits you best!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680140/extras/002fc566a949790d2e06b23d1a5c14e0.poster.avif?t=1725711631\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680140/extras/002fc566a949790d2e06b23d1a5c14e0.webm?t=1725711631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680140/extras/002fc566a949790d2e06b23d1a5c14e0.mp4?t=1725711631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Come on, use all your skills and strategy to reach the highest peak!</strong>",
