> During your climb, you may find that there are multiple paths\u2014some more difficult, some easier. There could be surprising traps, or perhaps hidden shortcuts that help you soar! Every road leads to Rome, so find the path that suits you best!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680140/extras/002fc566a949790d2e06b23d1a5c14e0.poster.avif?t=1725711631\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680140/extras/002fc566a949790d2e06b23d1a5c14e0.webm?t=1725711631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680140/extras/002fc566a949790d2e06b23d1a5c14e0.mp4?t=1725711631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Come on, use all your skills and strategy to reach the highest peak!</strong>",
